========================================================================================================
what I did was soft linked /usr/X11/lib/mesa to /usr/X11/lib/NVIDIA and copied libGLU from mesa to the nvidia folder.

thats the one file that we dont provide. Now I dont have to worry about somebody accidentally picking up sw rendering
by screwing their lib paths.

oh and for glut you can use the CSWfreeglut package  from blastwave


========================================================================================================
this is how you compile it btw

cc -lGL -lGLU -lglut -lm checker.c 

ldd a.out 
